

PROJECT TITLE
LEGALEASE – AI-POWERED LEGAL DOCUMENT GENERATOR

1. DEVELOPMENT OVERVIEW

LegalEase is developed to generate structured and customizable legal documents using Generative AI.

2. DEVELOPMENT PROCESS

• Collect legal document details from the user.
• Validate the input data.
• Construct a structured AI prompt.
• Send the prompt to the Gemini AI model.
• Receive the generated legal document content.
• Format the generated content into different document formats.

3. INPUT DATA

The system processes:

• Document type
• Involved parties
• Terms and conditions
• Effective dates

4. BACKEND DEVELOPMENT

FastAPI is used to handle API requests and communicate with the Gemini AI generation core.

5. AI DEVELOPMENT

The Gemini integration generates legal document content using structured prompts based on the user's provided details.

6. DOCUMENT FORMATTING

The generated content is converted into:

• DOCX
• PDF
• HTML preview

7. FRONTEND DEVELOPMENT

Streamlit provides the user interface for entering details, editing generated content and downloading documents.

8. DEVELOPMENT RESULT

The developed system provides a workflow for generating, editing and exporting customized legal documents.
